        StaticItem("Slayer Steel Blade", "Special Ability: Sweeping Strike\nWhile standing still or sneaking deal small AoE damage", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Naval Map", "This ancient map is centered around a landmass\nthat is very distinct from Vailor. However,\nan island not unlike modern Laureh'lin is\nvisible in its northwest corner.\n*Moderator Approved*\nCombustionary approved this item.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Harp", "A very beautifully handcrafted instrument\nmade of a dark wood. It has golden\ndecorations that look like vines with leaves\nas well as flora on it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Teen] Elmindreda Torena.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("A small gem", "A glowing moonbound crystal. It flows with a\nmagical blue energy. It gives of an aura of\npeace and a sense of wellbeing. [[PM\nADAM_BARNETT FOR INTERACTION]]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Adam_barnett.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ashford's Reserve", "A dark, creamy, oaked red wine.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonscaled Leggings", "This recipe discovers the item\nDragonscaled Leggings", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Dragonscaled Boots", "This recipe discovers the item\nDragonscaled Boots", "minecraft:map", ""),
        StaticItem("Backpack", "Note: This is roleplay item for heists", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Oil", "You won't be surviving if you drink this.\nIt's an oil used in weapons and armor,\nmade to chill the skin of those it touches,\nslowing their movement greatly.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Lightweight Leather", "", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Sealed Thanhic-Powered Icebox", "A sealed box that is used to keep food cold,\nusing the power of Thanhium. The Thanhium has been\nproperly sealed to keep the food toxin free, but\nas a concequence only raw food types can be put inside\nsafely.\nBrought to you by Greg Corp. [TM Greg 1541]\nGreg Corp is not responsible for possible\ninjuries, thanhic poisoning, or fatalities that may occur\nwhile operating the device.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Odd Ingot", "This seemingly purified aurum ingot is silky\nsmooth, no matter what you do to try dent it,\nit holds! Any attempts to smith the object\nwould fail.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AnotherDay.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Soothing Ointment", "An ointment that gives a soothing\nand relaxation sensation when\nrubbed onto the skin.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Greater Crouching feather infusion", "An infusion made from Crouching Feather,\nwith Aqua Vitae as a base. It makes you\nmore capable to jump higher than before.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Freezing Salve", "Almost freezing to the touch, this salve may\nallow you to pass through the hot climates\nof the world.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Serpent's Stalk", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nThis brew aids in healing burn wounds.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Broom", "A simple broom of tarnished wood and\nstraw, bound by a brass ring.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Maidservant.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Cracked Emerald Necklace", "A cracked and dirty emerald hangs from a dull\nsteel chain.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Lu's Jade Ji", "A ornate Ji wrapped with red cloth along it's\nhandles. The weapon is rarely used among the\nHou-zi and looks as if it is new.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lu Bu.", "minecraft:diamond_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Stud", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dragon Scale", "An ancient dragon scale found\non creatures in the harshest of environments\nfrom days long past.\nIt still seems to have some of it's old\ntexture. Perhaps it can be reused?", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Fencing Sword", "The epee is as long as a foil, but has a much\nheavier blade with a triangular cross-section\nand fluting along the sides of the blade. The\nshape, weight and fluting originated with the\nrapier, a dueling sword on which the epee was\nbased. The design of the rapier was primarily\nintended to inflict a thrusting wound with a\nblade that would allow blood to flow more\nfreely. The epee is also a thrusting weapon\nand points are scored by striking anywhere on\nthe body. The guard, therefore, is cup-shaped\nto protect the hand and wrist from being a\npotential target. Fencing with the epee most\nclosely simulates the conditions of an actual\nduel.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruskan Cigar", "A stick of bundled up sun dried tobacco\nleaves, mixing the unmissable scent of\ntraditional Ruskan pineforests with the\nexotic smell of Savoyard plantations.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Jonificus.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Shreck'Lak Flavoured Ice Cream", "", "minecraft:ice", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Scarf", "A somewhat unsightly blue scarf. Though it\nseems to have been made by a novice, it sure\nis warm!", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("-+- Niccum Bodee's Supreme Rack o' Ribs -+-", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Sir_Niccum.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Smudged Charcoal", "As the name suggests this inky black\nsubstance can be smeared on objects to dye\nthem.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AerialKaibab.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Golden Coin", "", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gus's Birthday Cake", "Happy birthday Gus!", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("The Iron Stomach", "The steel that forged this war axe is almost\nas strong as the stomach of the man who won\nit. Legends speak of his name, the best\ndrinker in all the known lands, with this axe\nhe was said to have fell countless numbers on\nthe battlefields.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KBR.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fencing Trousers", "", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Fencing Boots", "", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Lord Bonehill's Bone Staff", "★Player Approved★\nSigned by SaintPaint.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple Rock", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Sausage and eggs", "Grown up's breakfast.\nFood: 6\nSaturation: 9.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_beef", ""),
        StaticItem("Honeyed Ham", "Food: 8\nSaturation: 15.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_porkchop", ""),
        StaticItem("Jesucristo", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Raven: True Loyalty", "A short story written by Corvus Keint\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.\nSignature: Corvus Keint", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Windswept Staff", "An excellent but\nunremarkable walking stick.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum-tipped Pike", "A pike designed to dismount horseriders\nEffected by Unbreaking", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Nether's Wrath", "A terrifying concoction which is prone\nto melting glass, so a stone containment\nwould be required for this liquid. Due\nto how bright this smooth running\nconcoction is, it would be painful to\neven look at. Nether knows what it\nwould be like if one were to touch it,\nlet alone drink it.\nMore ingredients may be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Ticket", "With this simple piece of parchment, you can\ncollect and gather up to partake in a\nsplendid event within the Adelburg Festival!\nSee how much you can get, and gather in\nexchange for a splendid prize.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ♕ The Imperial Administration ♕.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Memes", "Food: 1\nSaturation: 0.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cookie", ""),
        StaticItem("Wooden Doll", "Before you is a wooden doll with a small\nround head that amazingly can spin to look\naround! It has a patch of black wool for hair\nand a beautiful gold-guilded mid-green dress\nwith white folds (for mobility) between the\nlegs. She has a courtly smile etched on her\nface.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by func_Soap.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Blue Axe Plushie", "You hold a soft blue plushie in the shape of\nan axe. Great for children!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Allieice.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Karate (or Kung Fu) Egg ★", "Some rumour that the hou-zi once got into\nmartial arts and began to break bricks with\ntheir bare hands. There was a point that they\ncould break even a thousand bricks at once,\nbut then, a suspicious easter orc came and\ngave them some easter eggs that couldn't be\nbroken even by the strongest of the hou-zi.\nNow, one of these very eggs rests on your\nhand, but it was softened with the power of\nlove. Also, it tastes of chocolate and peanut\nbutter. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("? Tasty Egg ?", "An easter egg found deep underground trapped\ninside the preserved bones of ancestral\ncreatures, and yet, the eggs seem to be\nintact. It probably did no good to these\nterryfing creatures, but it should be fine to\neat for you since it tastes of strawberries,\nnuts and chocolate. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Warped Egg ★", "An egg so awesome that you can see straight\nthrough it alongside the fact that its cold.\nThe most questionable mages say that these\neggs came from the warping of the soul of the\ngreatest of the voidal terrors, but this\ndoesn't changes the fact that it tastes like\ncoconut and milk. Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Knowledge", "", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Toalak Slime", "", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Brew of Harmony", "A marvelous concoction of a light green hue.\nIf drank, it cleans the stomach of toxins and\nacids, making the person feel relaxed\nand well feed. It can also be used to purify\nthe outside of the body, this liquid many\ntimes used to clean alchemy ingredients\nand precious gems.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Whale Oil", "A waxy liquid obtained from the head cavity\nof sperm whales. It is a clear, yellowish\nliquid with a very faint odor.", "minecraft:milk_bucket", ""),
        StaticItem("Ambergris", "a solid, waxy, flammable substance of a dull\ngrey or blackish colour, produced in the\ndigestive system of sperm whales. The\nsubstance is considered extremely expensive\nand widely used in the production of very\nhigh-end perfumes.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Green", "Made by Leilatha Devione, this green will\nleave you seeing stars for hours. There would\nbe a small tink of blue in the green, once\nsmoked you would begin to see the stars more\nclearly. WARNING: Do not give to children\nunder the age of 20\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Laced Cactus Green", "A large chunk of cactus green which has a\nstrong scent of mint to it. If smoked, or\ningested. The user would find themselves\nhaving a much more potent high than regular\ngreen. It also giving them blurred vision,\nand faltering balance when trying to walk or\nstand.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-studded Tunic", "Crafted by a particular magi, the wearer of\nthis armor would find themselves near immune\nto high powered (Tier 5) spells of Arcanism,\nElectrical Evocation, And Fire Evocation for\na maximum of up to five hits. The armor\nitself would appear to be a leather\nchestplalte, with chainmail lining the inside\nalong with covering the cracks between the\narms and torso. Either shoulder would also\nhave a metalic plate covering it.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:leather_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Enchanted Staff", "A ornately adorned, five-foot tall staff with\na low-humming diamond lacing its top. The\nshaft is neatly designed with floral\npatterns, lines branching out to the side to\nbe followed by flowers and the like. Three\nmedium-sized bolts before it needs\nrecharging.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Perplexed_Aris.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Vodnik 'Heart", "A horrid squirm-y creature with dozens of\nwrithing antennae, poking about for a drowned\nthroat to climb into. I exhudes a protective\nlayer of slime-- Poisonous, paralytic slime.\nDon't let it bite you!... At least, if it's\nstill alive, that is. Without a host, it\ncan't last too long.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Vodnik.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-studded Leggings", "Crafted by a particular magi, the wearer of\nthis armor would find themselves near immune\nto high powered (Tier 5) spells of Arcanism,\nElectrical Evocation, And Fire Evocation for\na maximum of up to five hits. The armor\nitself would appear to be a mix between\nchainmail and a leather pants, with the\nchainmail showing at the joints and lining\nthe interior.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:leather_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Bumbling Ballerina", "A ballerina straw-doll evidently made by a\nchild's hands.The fabric of pink was tied\nround its body to mimic a Ballerina's\ncostume, followed through by strings of wool\nclasped together for her hair.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by the Elf,\n- Adeline Carcimor", "minecraft:hay_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Pot", "Within this clay pot would be a pack amount\nof cactus green, scent lingering with its\nstrong quick in the face, and hue the purest\nof all. However, upon taking out the herbs\nwithin it would appear to refill itself no\nmatter what!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-studded Boots", "Crafted by a particular magi, the wearer of\nthis armor would find themselves near immune\nto high powered (Tier 5) spells of Arcanism,\nElectrical Evocation, And Fire Evocation for\na maximum of up to five hits. The armor\nitself would appear to be mere leather boots,\nyet on the inside, they would be lined with\nwool.. Able to keep the user warm even in\nsome of the coldest inviornments\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("A Diamond Embedded Ring", "Granted to the recipient is a silver band,\nsuspended by an ebon cord and knotted clasp.\nThe metal appears to have been scuffed\nsomewhat from excessive wear, yet from a\ndistance the shimmering gem is enough to\nevade observation from its blemishes.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Erinali.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Bone Flute", "This bone has been widdled down into a flute\ntype structure. It seems ornate and light.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by 6xdestroyer.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Cosmic Egg ★", "An easter egg that was launched into space\nfrom another planet with a catapult, and,\nduring its course, it crossed a\nspace-rainbow, acquiring all of its tastes.\nYou can't define the flavour, but it tastes a\nbit like... sugar. Did it even come from\nsomewhere else? Happy easter!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bottle Of Acid Slime", "The contents of this bottle contain acid from\nthe minor spirit Yerkath, Spirit of Slime.\nThe slime, when active would consume any\norganic material to obsorb its mass and\nenergy.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Yerkath, Spirit of Slime.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Seed Token", "A glowing token, perhaps it is redeemable?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by teegah.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Gem-Incrusted Spear", "A goblin sized, five and half foot long spear\ntipped with a metalic head where a gemstone\nwould rest at its very center. Should a\nspecific verbal command be uttered, the\nspears head would begin to spew electricity!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold-studded Cowl", "Crafted by a particular magi, the wearer of\nthis armor would find themselves near immune\nto high powered (Tier 5) spells of Arcanism,\nElectrical Evocation, And Fire Evocation for\na maximum of up to five hits. The armor\nitself would appear to be a mix between a\nchainmail coif and a leather helmet, with the\nchainmail on the inside.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lhindir.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Admiral's Badge", "Worn by the first admiral of the Grand\nKingdom of Urguan\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Admiral Shank Goldhand.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Purple shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Skull of jondead1", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Frost Witch Blood", "The cold blood of a Frost Witch, chilled to\nthe touch. Condensation gathers around the\nglass in warm areas.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Assassinofawsome.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Goblin Skull", "The decapitated head of a goblin from the\nDeeproads.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheBulter.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Ceona", "Intricate little vines of royal gold wrap\ndelicately around the wrist, meandering in\ngraceful harmony with one-another along this\nbracelet. A spiral of carefully detailed\ngolden leaves cradle a sparkling four-pointed\ndiamond, hosting a gentle white light that\nseems to pulse, ever-so-noticeably.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Mackerel", "0.0lbs, 7\nExpires in 1d 21h 42m", "minecraft:fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Dented Crown", "A dented and aged crown. Upon putting on the\ncrown, you feel as if you no longer need any\nvaluables to stay satisfied. After wearing\nthe crown for more than ten minutes, you get\na nosebleed.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Kurumi Shrub", "A smelly shrub rests in your hands, it feels\nsmooth to the touch, but every touch seems to\nrelease a different rancid smell.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:sapling", ""),
        StaticItem("Classic Cactus Green", "In your hands, a prime piece of cactus green\nrests. With cactus farmed from the old\ndeserts by poorly paid goblins, where it was\nafterwards made into a paste and sold to you.\nThis cactus green is undoubtfully the best\none you can ever place your lips upon whilst\nhaving a strong scent and a quick jab of a\nbreeze on your head, continuing as you blaze\nit further. Made by Eath'Lur.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Eath'Lur.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearl Powder", "A beautiful powder used for whitening of the\nskin, made with crushed pearls.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by MarinaEmily.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shuka Rock", "A hardened rock, once broken open a strange\nliquid would flow from inside, releasing\neuphoric fumes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:clay_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Incarnated Quilted Footsteps", "This fine pair of boots seems to have\nsomething special to them. Their fluffy\ninsides and soft yet tough exterior allow for\na comfortable but durable pair of boots.\nAlthough the boots seem to look new, they\nalso appear old. Perhaps you aren't the first\nperson to set foot inside these special pair\nof boots.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Belvedere Bank Stock", "Buy stock in the Belvedere Bank Building! You\ncan exchange it back for mina exactly where\nyou bought it. Keep an eye on the prices\nbecause the value of this stock will rise and\nfall, depending on the success of the\nBelvedere Bank Building.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by John Galt Redimet.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Etched Pottery Vase", "Crafted by the expert hands of a warhawke,\nthis terracotta vase is slim on it's neck and\nthick on the bottom. Intricately designed by\nthe artists' fingers, the design used mimics\nthat of a bird's feather pattern, repeating\nall through out.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiney Boots", "What seems to be a pair of fancy boots that\nshine with glitter. They appear to be\nabsolutely fancy! And could be suitable for\nanyone - even GOD!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Diamond Wedding Ring", "", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Warhawkian Mosaic Terracotta Bowls", "Crafted by the expert hands of a warhawke,\nthis mosaic terracotta bowls are made by\nbreaking glass, and expertly placing them on\nthe base bowl with tak glue to provide an\nantique design! http://bit.ly/2l1DnLT", "minecraft:bowl", ""),
        StaticItem("Poster", "Gaern Briarheart, Kingsguard to Abdes de\nSavin is looking for skilled fighters. Said\nfighters will be paid and given residence\nshould they be chosen to enter the service.\nIf you are interested, send a bird to\nAsterleigh addressed to him, or find and\nspeak to him in person in Asterleigh.\" - The\nparchment is stamped with the sigil of a\nlaughing tree.", "minecraft:painting", ""),
        StaticItem("Grym", "A long-handled Polehammer, with a gnarled\nhammerhead, crows beak, and spearpoint at its\ntop end. The handle bears carvings of wheat\nand vines, adorned with strong steel\nbracings. The handles bottom end is of strong\nsteel also, a broad cap in shape, perfect for\nstriking with. The balance of the weapon is\nsuprisingly good, concidering its size of\n6'2ft.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bloodnight.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Rionnag", "A 4'9ft Flamberge with two barbs at the base\nof the blade, sitting above a thin, yet\nsturdy crossguard with upward-curving ends.\nThe edge of the blade is extremely sharp, and\nis also quite light for its size. It is\nobvious that the blade is used for rending,\nrather than cutting. The Pommel ends at a\nsharp point, assumingly used for puncturing\narmor.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Bloodnight.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Shrimp Pasta", "The rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:cooked_fish", ""),
        StaticItem("Crimson Wine", "A dark red wine that has been mixed with\nvarious spices to create a hearty drink.\nCan be served hot or cold.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kalen Forseth.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Satchel of Holding", "Arcane I\nA strange leather satchel with a string cord\nto tie the satchel shut. If someone were to\nlook at the bottom of the satchel they'd find\na large fist sized diamond that shimmers with\nthe occasional magical glow. If the correct\nphrase is murmured a translocation rift\nshould appear inside of the satchel, allowing\nfor something like infinite storage. It must\nbe recharged every three activations.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Star of Metztli", "A staggeringly beautiful gemstone of a\nshimmering blue jewel. Crafted and polished\nto near perfection. Fit for a king.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Mace", "This Slayersteel mace would present a\npleasent yet dull glow. The said mace would\nhave a 2ft long shaft made of oak wood, the\nFangs of the mace would spread out evenly as\nto deal the most damage upon armoured\napponents. It would be durable and strong\nbut, would break apart due to it's alloy and\nis somewhat weak to bluesteel.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SPace_Matrix.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Heavy Stone Spade", "", "minecraft:stone_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Dart", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Porridge", "For those without minas.\nFood: 4\nSaturation: 0.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Ascended Blood", "The vial contains a sap-like blood from an\nAscended.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Imbued Gauntlet", "Arcane I\nA gauntlet which vibrated upon touch, a\nkeyslot was carved in place; in the palm of\nit's piece. Meant for a certain key. This\ngauntlet was made for both right and left\nhand.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Old Dragon Warhammer", "A warhammer that must be decades old, with a\nworn handle and weathered edges. On either\nend of the hammer, a dragon is clumsily\netched into the steel, which reeks of\nectoplasm.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Witches Clarity", "A beautifully crafted pendant of mage gold,\nmany engravings running along the side of it.\nThose who wore this would slowly find that\ntheir negative emotions fade away slightly,\nallowing them to easily feel more positive. A\nblue gem rests within its center.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Delmodan.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Glowing Shrapnel", "Arcane I\nShrapnel plate, of small size which fell from\nsomething gargantuan. Extremely resilient to\nharsh conditions, and almost as hard as\nCarabum. Glowing streaks of light and dark\nblue-hues in random areas of the piece. It\nseemed to have no use… perhaps.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Azdromoth.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("The Orenian's Honor Brooch", "A Bright Green Shield is Cut into the Finely\nPrepared Emerald Brooch, The Orenian Seal\nShines when held up to the sunlight. Those\nwho wear the brooch show their undying\nsupport for the Empire, and their Gratitude\nto the Forces who Protect them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by The Imperial Brigade.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("you a IDIOT", "4.4lbs, 24\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Hexe_.\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:fish", ""),
