        StaticItem("Nightsap Mead", "An alluring, golden drink with a perfectly\nsoothing flavor, mostly unspoiled by the\nbrewing process, like drinking a bottle full\nof molten honey. Taking a whiff makes one\ndizzy, betraying a rather sinister\nconnotation to the drink... Its brew conceals\na base of concentrated Nightsap. This is a\npoison.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
