        StaticItem("smokey de_bear XD", "", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Pearlstaff", "A lacquered wooden staff topped with a fist\nsized translucent pearl. When held to direct\nlight, the pearl causes a colorful spectrum\nof filtered light to bathe the beholder. The\nstaff is enchanted to emit a one-use beam of\nlight, capable of temporarily dazing or\nblinding a target.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Wand", "This carved length of wood has ivy etchings\ncurling around the top section. The handle is\nsmooth and plain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by daanyolx3.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Bladed Wand", "This sturdy length of wood is coated with a\nblack lacquer. A sharp ornamental blade with\nelaborate etched designs protrudes from the\ntip. The handle is wrapped with a cherry\ncolored suede for comfort.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by daanyolx3.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stellar Wand", "An intricately carved length of wood. A\ndepiction of the cosmos is etched across the\nbody of the wand, and it is headed with a\ntiny crystal shaped to look like a star. The\ncrystal exudes a soft glow.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by daanyolx3.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("➳ Hearthstrike [T5] ➳", "Arcane I\nOne of many weapons made popular by Emberco,\na holy weapons company stationed in the\ndwarven city of Kal’Omith. The Hearthstrike\narrow is designed to hit ‘em where it hurts,\npiercing corrupted flesh and setting the\nimmediate area on fire with beautiful holy\nflame. Touch the arrowhead to prime the\narrow, setting it ablaze, and then fire it\ninto your soul-afflicted foe. Each quiver\ncomes with a complete manual of operation.\nhttps://goo.gl/5REHzg\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Academia's Patronus", "A palm sized dove sculpture wrought from\nsilver with a gemstone set into it's chest.\nThe gemstone, upon activation, causes the\ndove to emit a soft light. Furthermore, the\ngemstone has spells within that enable the\ndove to appear to be flying; Controllable by\nthe creator.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Academia's Aegis", "A mage gold bracelet sporting a sizable\ndiamond. The figures of two dove baubles rise\nfrom the band, cradling the gem betwixt their\nelegantly crafted beaks. Ivy etchings sprawl\nacross the surface of the gold band, seeming\nto coil endlessly around the jewelry. After a\ngesture the enchanted gem begins to produce a\nsingle round shield wrought from emerald hued\narcanism.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Magneton, Fist of the Monolith", "A singular steel gauntlet forged to fit a\ndelicate hand. Golden ivy etchings coil\naround the surface of the dull grey exterior,\ngiving the armor some flair. A sizable green\ngemstone is embedded on the underside of the\ngauntlet. After a tap the gemstone activates,\ncausing dense layers of a peculiar mineral to\ncoat the surface of the item. The stone\ncovering seems to hold an intense attraction\nto metal; The range of magnetism extending in\na five block radius around the user wherein\nloose piece of metal will be forcefully\npulled towards the stone gauntlet.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Earth_Evocation.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Saffron Stilletto Dagger\" [T4]", "Arcane I\nFancy stiletto dagger, the blade would be\nmade of aurum while the small hilt is ornated\nwith silver, on the middle of the handle\nthere would be an ideogram made of aurum, if\nit is tapped twice it would invoke a thin\nlayer of golden soulfire along the blade with\nspikes made of the same ethereal energy. If\nthe soulfire enters in direct contact with a\ncorrupted being it would cause an unbearable\npain and burn their tissues. (( PM suxals for\nmore information ))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Zindran.", "minecraft:golden_sword", ""),
