        StaticItem("Potion of Athin", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nWhen applied to skin or armor,\nit provides a minor defence against\nflames & fire.\nUnable to be applied to metalic armors.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Moderate Potion of Acuity", "A finished concoction of Moderate Strength\nA favorite of hunters everywhere, this potion\nenables theuse to be more aware of his sorroundings.\nHis senses peak and is able to do actions faster.\nHowever, after usage this potion numbs the previously\nheightened senses, and decreases combat effectivity.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Desert Vitality", "A liquid often used by desert wanderers to\nhelp them stay longer without food.\nIt increases resistance by shutting down some\nmucles, causing the body to focus its energy on\nsurviving. It lowers preformance in exchange for vitality.\nMore ingredients can be added.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Campfire kit", "Excellent for the construction of campfires.", "minecraft:flint_and_steel", ""),
