        StaticItem("Speckled Brown Egg", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyrssa Fawn", "This gangly legged creature would have a\nsingle antler upon it's forehead, a pair of\ncloven hooves, and a horse like tail. It\nwould be covered in small crystals as well as\nits horn would be coated in them. Though\nsmall now it would become the size of a moose\nwhen an adult.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Rella101.", "minecraft:quartz_block", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Bat Plushie", "A large, near-perfect replica plushie of a\nHallow's Eve bat. It was complete with floppy\nwings, wide ears, and large glass eyes that\nhad an eerie amount of realism to their\nfeatures. You swore it moved out of the\ncorner of your own eyes.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Mini Pool-Noodle", "Arcane I\nA small blue pool noodle, perfect for the\nlittle ones to use. Oddly enough when the\nnoodle was placed into water it would change\nthe color, turning it a bright aqua color.\nThe words 'Veris Summer Festival, 1618' would\nbe engraved into the noodle.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("111111 Spoopy Candle 111111", "A tiny wax jack-o-lantern with a gleeful face\nradiates creepily with a cold harsh glare with it\nlit wick. It gives off the scent of rotting pumpkins.\nDo not use as nightlamp. Commerates Laureh'lin's\nGrand Harvest Festival in 1524.", "minecraft:torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Black Cat Plushie", "Every feature upon the near-perfect replica\nplushie appeared quite realistic. The bright\nglass eyes highlighted against the darkened\nsoft fur. As you hold it, you heard the\nfaintest 'meow' off in the distance\noccasionally.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Pool Noodle Sword", "A medium sized pool noodle bastard sword.\nWhen you hit someone with it, the sword would\nsimply bounce off them. Great for play\nfightin! On the hilt of the sword would be\nthe words 'Veris Summer Festival, 1618\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Water Blaster", "Arcane I\nThis appears to be some form of crossbow, but\nit has a small tank that can be filled with\nwater at the back. When you use the odd\nlittle contraption, it's water would appear\nto be some magenta color instead of the\nnormal color. When the water makes contact\nwith skin, it stains the skin for a day! Have\nFun! On the tank of water would be the words\nVeris Summer Festival, 1618\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RideTheSky.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Erin Doll", "A crude figure made of bent and tied together\nbits and pieces of sugar cane, tied together\nwith bits of twine and tree sap holding the\narms and legs in place. The head would have\nfrayed twine for hair, made to crudely\nresemble Erin. It would be clothed in a blue\nand white dress, much like a smaller version\nof Erin's, and done very simply, by someone\nwith little skill.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:reeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Meteorite Shard", "A chunk of space rock filled with an unknown\nmineral.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:emerald_ore", ""),
        StaticItem("Von Königsberg Silver", "A 1 Kilogram ingot of pure silver, complete\nwith the imprint of the Königsbergs.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by KaiserThoren.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll's Foot", "A foot cut from a troll, the blood around the\nwound has dried.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Gorgemel.", "minecraft:rabbit_hide", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk Feather", "The large feather belonging to a Giant Hawk.\nThese quills once served as a tool to soare\nthe skies. It's underside is soft like a\npillow but its edges are brutally sharp.\nCareful!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Bloodwood Branch", "A branch taken from the bough of a bloodwood\ntree.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Shambleau.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Spine of an Ancient Sea Creature", "This long spine originated from the back of\nan ancient sea creature. Sturdy and\nresiliant, it once provided a creature with a\nstrong defense. It would make a fine trophy,\nor perhaps you can find a use for it!\nCareful, don't poke yourself in the eye!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Ketterfish", "This is a pufferfish species native to\nSoteria. It is larger than the common\npufferfish, and has a purple color pattern.\nIts poison glands are slightly larger than\nthe common pufferfish, and require delicacy\nto extract.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Giant Hawk's Eye", "The large yellow eye of a Giant Hawk. It's\npiercing gaze continues on in death, sending\na shiver up your spine. You'd be fearful to\nmeet its original owner alone! Eww, it's\nstill wet!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:slime_ball", ""),
        StaticItem("Volcanic Glass", "This is a cubic meter of volcanic glass. It\nis a delicate form of obsidian.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Magicpastry.", "minecraft:stained_glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Druidic Summer Seeds", "Seeds blessed through the gifts of powerful\ndruids. When planted, these seeds will sprout\ninto an array of yellow, orange, and red\nflowers. They exhibit a small aesthetic\ndisplay of dancing flame across each bud.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell of Cernunnos", "A seashell used by numerous crabs for their\nhomes, or to protect from the wilds. Now,\nabandoned and left to the will of nature.\nThis unique, mystical item can be held to\none's ear as they would hear the marches of\nthe wilds.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Mark of the Wronged.", "A small totem, cut out of wood. It would\nrepresent a shield, with a heart upon it.\nNotice-able was a bluesteel coin dug into the\nback, which is removeable.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Billhook Axe", "This Billhook axe would be the length of 4.5\nft with a large billhook blade on one side\nand the other side being a spike, the steel\nof the blade would be a solid black, the\nhandle would be made of a strong dark oak\nbranch, the engravings in the steel would be\nof old carvings of the four brothers sitting\namungst the creator, with Iblees and Aeriel\non opposit sides of the four brothers\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Malinor.", "minecraft:iron_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("The Drake Buster", "This massive crossbow is an abomonation. It's\nmounted upon a small, horsesized cart, with 4\nwheels. It requires two folks to crank the\nstring, and fires spear sized bolts.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("Seashell of Cerridwen", "A seashell that has seen the test of time.\nBattered and beaten, yet still colorful and\nvibrant in all its glory. With an array of\ncolors on it, if held up to the light, it\nwill display numerous moving images against\nnearby surface. These images would appear to\nbe an absract visualization of life.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by [Wisteria Druid] Renn.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Vodnik Head", "These are retrieved heads from swamp\nabominations from the Blackwald. These are\ntrophies for those who had slain them, an\nimpressive feat.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Skeletal Helmet", "A helmet that was once adorned by a skeletal\nwarrior! Now that it was forcefully taken,\nyou are able to see the skeletal scenes\ncarved into the darker metal trims... and the\nlarge hole made by a hammer.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheMoonMonk.", "minecraft:iron_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Malineer's Special Sugar", "When inhaled it has hallucinogenic properties", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
        StaticItem("Strange Diary", "A strange book with neat letters sewn into\nthe leather cover, spelling out \"Diary\"...\nAll seems normal until you write into it with\nink.. [Contact AnotherDay to interact.]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AnotherDay.", "minecraft:book", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Hair Piece", "A golden ornate hair piece embellished with\ncrimson poinsettia flowers and small white\ndiamonds that sparkle in the light.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by The Imperial Family.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ornate Bracelet", "This beautiful ornate bracer would lay\ncomfortably around one's wrist. It is made of\ngold and silver, formed in a woven patern,\nover eachother. The gold and silver streaks\nare set with diamonds and opals,\nrespectively. The gemstones would shine\nbeautifully when light hits them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Nekkore.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Goobers Bane", "A great longbow, engraved with various runes\nand patterns along it's shaft. Made from the\nwood, sweat, and toil of Quarryville, it was\ncreated following the great battle of\nQuarryville and is a must have for anyone\nseeking to slay degenerates!\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Hero_Prodigy.", "minecraft:bow", ""),
        StaticItem("The Witch's Ring", "A simple golden ring, with the small shape of\nan upside-down triangle clumsily carved into\nits side. Possessed by an aurageist, this\nring changes the colour of one’s magic to a\ntwisted, dark, glowing, half-opaque purple,\nspare holy magic. The wielder of the ring\nfeels soft tingles on the worn area of flesh.\nThe tingling would slowly grow in magnitude,\nreaching heavy levels of pain if not taken\noff for a few hours. This ring was surely\nmeant for a finger that didn’t feel pain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AlFalah.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Druidic Cake", "A rather simple cake, with a variety of\nleaves and herbs occupying the mound of\ndelicious fluff. If one were to consume the\ndruidic sweet, they would be met with an\nintense euphoria. Their surroundings taking\non a more sugary appearance, and their ears\nmet with the sounds of glee despite even the\nmost grim occasions. Some say they even hear\nthe Aspects themselves whisper to them.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:cake", ""),
        StaticItem("Tainted Sword", "A two handed blade shining with a slight ebon\nhue, when rending flesh the blade inflicted\nupon its victim a T4 Necromancer's drain. And\nif not wielded by a necromancer, the stray\nlife coalesced along the blade in the form of\na thin black fluid, corrosive to anything\nwith life-force.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Archi's Friendship Bread", "Food: 4\nSaturation: 3.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:bread", ""),
        StaticItem("A Carved Bone", "The thigh bone of a horse with the carving of\na symbol that looks like an eye but that the\nknife had never been lifted in it's carving.\nIt is the symbol of a wargoth of Clan Gorkil.\nIn a crude kind of penmanship it would read\nA debt. The War Uzg owes the weilder of this\ntoken a favor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Jandy_.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Rose Bouquet", "A large bouquet of roses wrapped in an\noff-white curl of papyrus paper.", "minecraft:double_plant", ""),
        StaticItem("Cockatrice Feather", "A rather large feather that looks as if it\ncame from a very, very large chicken.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ski_king3.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Fossilized Branch", "This is an ancient branch of an unknown\nspecies of tree. For some time before being\ndiscovered, it must have been buried under\nthe earth -- it has begun the process of\nmineralization, with its exterior rendered\nhard and flakey, like stone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Aengul Eye", "An impossibly precious gem,\nbrimming with potential.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Scale", "A sharp and jagged peice, about 1 foot long\nweighing a decent amount, with a shimmering\nexterior it would have an menevolent beauty\nto it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Laxative Apple", "Who knows what will happen if you eat this apple?", "minecraft:apple", ""),
        StaticItem("Chocolate Egg", "An almost baseball sized chocolate egg\nwrapped in golden foil -- an image of an\nangry duck stomping a tuft of grass mirrored\non both sides.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by AcidGoosey.", "minecraft:spawn_egg", ""),
        StaticItem("Casket", "What boons lie within?", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Shackles", "A pair of cuffs held together by chains with\na simple lock.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Elizabeth.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Askr Af Ulfrikr", "An ornate Gorundyr winged spear, every\ncarving that graces the metal coated of its\nshaft worn from the many wars its been in. A\nlarge hand print shaped blood stain wraps\naround the middle of the shaft. Near the\nbottom a tripwire hook would hang.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by SoberMutt.", "minecraft:iron_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Gjota Mushrooms", "These flat-like fungi offer a sweet\nstench, unlike their taste, and are very\npale in colour. Little light brown specks\ndot it's crown. When eaten, these\nmushrooms will bring on an extreme high\nwithin minutes. Small dosages will make\nthe user very aware of their\nsurroundings.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by [Beylund] Ruari Hoarfrost of Orvar.", "minecraft:brown_mushroom", ""),
