        StaticItem("Luminous Aurum Warhammer", "Special Ability: Bone Break\n15% chance on full hit to cripple target.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Halflin' Moonshine", "A bottle of cheeky \"halflin' moonshine\",\nlaced with something unnoticeable to the\nnormal eye! ((PM DoctorGoosey for effects))\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by DoctorGoosey.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Arrow", "", "minecraft:arrow", ""),
        StaticItem("Fleur du Cantal - Vintage 1577", "A powerful aromatic red wine born from grapes\nof the Barony of Cantal. It's an Auvergnian\nstyle wine fermented in the traditional manor\nof the House Valois; world famous in Oren\nthroughout the ages. It sponsors full-bodied\nwine with a faintly earthy taste. It sports\nvintage of the year, 1577.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by french_king3.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Rabbit Noodle Soup", "Food: 8\nSaturation: 7.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:mushroom_stew", ""),
        StaticItem("Atatis Family Golden Duck", "A golden statuette of a duck. The golden\nsurface of the duck shines brilliantly,\nobviously well-maintained by its owners. On\nthe duck's back, one might notice a small\nengraving of a guitar crossed over a\npaintbrush.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Gryphon Feather", "A golden brown feather, once belonging to a\nmighty beast. It seems to shimmer when held\nup against the sunlight. The shaft of the\nglittering feather would likely make an\nexcellent quill, but to waste such a unique\nthing on an arrow would be foolish.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Rorel.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Haven Isle Snow Globe", "A glass globe with an oak base. Upon further\ninspection, a minature replica of Haven Isle\ncovered in snow. If one were to shake the\nglobe, minature bits of snow would fly all\naround the inside of the globe. A small\nplaque with writing upon it could be seen at\nthe base. 'For Shiloh. May you always\nremember our true home, my love.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Naz Atatis.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Box of Art Supplies", "A rather simple looking box, crafted from\noak. Upon examining the lid, a sigil could be\nspotted carved into the wood; a guitar and a\npaintbrush crossed over an open book. If one\nwere to open the box, they'd discover all\nsorts of art supplies: paints, ink,\npaintbrushes, quills and even a new apron\nwhich would fit a certain Mounsidian lady\nquite well.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Naz Atatis.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Shiloh's Silver Bracelet", "A bracelet crafted from pure silver. Tiny\nemeralds have been embedded into the metal.\nUpon a free section of the brace, words could\nbe spotted engraved in the metal. 'For my\nlove, Shiloh. No one can compare to her\nbeauty.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Naz Atatis.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Cursed Mirror", "A mirror supported by polished wood, for\nthose whom stare into may hallucinate of a\ntime in their past that brought; Misery,\nsorrow, anger, regret, or more.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:glass", ""),
        StaticItem("Tragedy Stack", "A stack of cards with tragedies painted\nacross them, if staring too long at them they\ncome to life - But only for the user.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by JVQ.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Bad Pun Award", "", "minecraft:prismarine_crystals", ""),
        StaticItem("Box of Sculpting Tools", "A rather large box, crafted from Oak. Upon\nopening the box, one would discover many\ndifferent tools, such as chisels, rasps, and\nrifflers. These are obviously the tools of a\nsculptor.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Naz Atatis.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("The Pain - WHO WAS THE FALLEN, IRRI'AYE", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by the Cosmic entity,\n- Unwin\nSignature: The Inquisitor", "minecraft:written_book", ""),
        StaticItem("Seeds", "Looks a little seedy.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Token of Theruz", "A small bone that knows many duplicates. All\nof which seem to be taken from animalistic\nskeletal frames. Inscribed are Shamanic Runes\nthat would refer and praise Theruz, Spirit of\nKnowledge. Surely a trinket worth owning for\nthose that persue knowledge and\nunderstanding.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by HedgeHug.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Food Cart", "A cart for food containment.\nClick on this item with uncooked food in your cursor to store.\nContains:\n64.0x Fish\nTo open, right click with the cart in main hand.", "minecraft:piston", ""),
