        StaticItem("The Bluesteel Blade of Oaths", "This Magnificent bluesteel blade shines\nbright with the strength of the bond between\nthe wielder and the crafter of this fine\nsword. The blade is strong and has intricate\ndesigns carved into the handle and blade, a\nwonderful work of an Orcish blacksmith.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kikiyami.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Mustang Druid Staff", "The staff was made from the branch of an\napple tree. There are two small buck antlers\nantlers tied to the head of it, with a few\nfeathers hanging from it as well. Further\ndown, leather is tightly wrapped around the\nwood to make a small grip for one to hold the\nstaff. Around the leather grip, small leaves\nand vines have been carved into the wood, one\nwould have to look closely to see them.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kikiyami.", "minecraft:wooden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Hawk Staff", "This staff is made of strong dark wood with\ngold ingraved into it. Atop the staff sits a\nhawk with wings out stretched, the eyes of\nthe hawk appear to be small blue gems. This\nstaff is the work of a fine crafter.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kikiyami.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Finalhazard.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Steel Flask", "A small flask made of steel, it's surface\nevidently having been through some wear and\ntear by the occasional scratch and dent upon\nits surface. Wrapped around the middle is a\nstrip of worn leather, keeping hands safe\nfrom the frigidness of the metal surface in\nwinter months.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Aethermoorian Armor", "This armor is finely and locally crafted with\nchainmail as the base, the only part that differs\nis the chest, having a golden sun of Aethermoore\ncrafted onto it.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:chainmail_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Self-threading needle", "This arcanic needle, wen sit on torn clothing,\nappears to fix it on its own, requiring not a\nperson to thread it through.\n*Moderator Approved*\nLifeforceIsMana approved this item.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Witch’s Broom", "A simple broom, it made of dark wood. A\ndeep, dark purple ribbon would be tied\ntowards its top. Eyes are placed creepily\nalong the broom’s shaft. Some insist they\nblink!", "minecraft:stick", ""),
