        StaticItem("Ceremonial Rapier of Santegia", "A long and slender rapier made of blue steel,\nthe blade gleaming brightly under light. It\nhad a cup hilt, decorated with priceless\nrubies, sapphires and emeralds, the outer rim\ncovered in gold. The handle is wrapped in\ngold cord, with a ruby pommel\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Brusleton Jewelry.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Blessed Holy Lorraine Cross", "A golden holy Lorraine cross, blessed by the\nVicar of GOD in the virtues of the Saints.\nThe cross is magnificently detailed and\nshines bright in the light of the sun. The\nbeholder's faith becomes the center of\nattention when worn.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mille Cultris", "The Vase of a Thousand Knives; the pattern of\nsharp blades go from top to bottom of this\nancient artefact, engraved with red-diamonds,\nfire opal and at the point of each curve a\nlarge Pearl is stuck.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Wendigo22793.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Duck Compass", "When you press on it, it quacks, it's duck\ndesign pointing to something, or somewhere.\n[!] Message Bathrugman to interact.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by moosehunter123.", "minecraft:record_13", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Future Egg ★", "An easter egg made of white chocolate even if\nthe technology of now doesn't allows such.\nProbably a fat rabbit travelled in time and\nwarped it through the fabric of space, but\nthis doesn't even changes the taste. Happy\neaster!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
