        StaticItem("Black Leather Gag", "A leather gag made out of the finest tanned\nleather. It was decorated with ferrum studs\nalong the strap, and was accompanied by a\nbuckle of the same metal. The mouth piece was\npadded for comfort.", "minecraft:leather_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("August's Boot's Boots", "A boot a day keeps the doctor away!", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Santegian Medal of Service", "The medal is a silver circular disc. Its\nobverse struck with the Savinian stallion\nupon its face, encircled with the words,\nOhorezko Domina\". The reverse depicting the\nlesser coat of arms of Santegia. It is\nattached to a yellow and blue striped ribbon.\nOriginally presented for outstanding\ncontributions to the Santegian military\nduring the Battle of Voron Bay, 1634, by\nLeoiarizaltzu Salbatzaile de Savin, King of\nSantegia.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Cornivore.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
