        StaticItem("Fièvre Brûlante", "A beautifully dated wine, being held in a\ncool basement for over fifty years. Its taste\nis extraordinary. A date is engraved upon the\nbottom of the bottle; '10th of Snow's Maiden,\n1585'.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Chateau Lafite", "A Magnificent bottle of red wine, the bottle\nof dark red so that the wine inside the\nclosed bottle look like a wave-shadow.\nBeneath the bottle, on the bottom lay a year\nscratched into it: 1535.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
