        StaticItem("Stuffed Cat", "A small plushed toy sewn tightly with thread\nholding hue akin to the fabrics which\nmanifested the kitten contour. Its eyes are\nblack buttons held onto its complexion of\nyawn whiskers, and a pink cotton nose.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by DrPhilOfLOTC.", "minecraft:leather", ""),
        StaticItem("Crystal Rhetanine Powder", "Mined in the depths of the Mountains of\nUrguan. This powder comes from a solution of\nFerrum ore, small doses of Thanium and a\nbroader mixture of dough and sugar. Dangerous\nto acquire and even more dangerous to abuse,\nit is used as a stronger pain reliever than\nopiates but when taken in too large a\nquantity can cause a fatal overdose without\nwarning. It can be smoked or inhaled but is\ninsoluable.", "minecraft:sugar", ""),
