        StaticItem("Preserved Black Truffle Slices", "A medium sized cylindrical bottle holding a\nfew small slices of black truffle suspended\nin a tannish yellow olive oil. A culinary\nremedy to make up for the scarcity of the\npungent delicacy that is the truffle.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:flint", ""),
        StaticItem("Q", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("DPM's Personal Leggings", "", "minecraft:diamond_leggings", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Lucerne", "The lucerne in your hands is of masterful\nquality, crafted and forged with aurum. There\nis a spike at the head of the warhammer,\nsuitable for thrusting. The hammer itself\nseems to have been crafted with steel, giving\nit a strong constitution, unlikely to break!\nThree runes are carved into the hilt, and\nseem to signify something.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by K0llu.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Apple", "", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Golden Crown", "A golden crown, with jewels\nincrusted into it's frame.\n*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_helmet", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Gemmed Ring", "A ring of black metal decorated with a large\nred gemstone.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TehLulu.", "minecraft:obsidian", ""),
        StaticItem("Bluesteel Rapier", "An elegantly forged, swept hilt rapier.\nLight as a feather to wield and sheathed\nin a polished black scabbard. Upon the base\nof the blade is the smith's mark, P.Y.\nOn the opposite side of the blade, the\ndepiction is engraved of a rayed sun,\nwith what appears to be a raindrop in its center.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by CosmicWhaleShark.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Metz 25 Minae Tax Paper", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Thatpyrodude.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Basilisk Fang", "The Sea Basilisks Fang is still sharp to the\ntouch, unbreakable to all materials, traces\nof Venom still on them, likely touching\nanysword of wood it would burn through. With\npure white sparkle and hard texture weighing\nat about 60 pounds and 6ft\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by ClergyManDan.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Scales", "The scales are very strong, and are almost\nimpenetrable. They can be used for a number\nof things; making tools, weapons, clothes, or\narmor. It is a great trophy for a person who\nhas aided in the attack!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Rthulan Phylactery", "A small white pouch made from dyed burlap,\nwith a long yellow string tieing it. Its\ncontents consist of a small scroll- inscribed\nwith the words 'Ｓｔｒｉｃｔｕｒｅ ２３： Ｏｎｅ ｍｕｓｔ ｆｉｎｄ\nｍｅｒｃｙ ｗｉｔｈｉｎ ｔｈｅｍｓｅｌｖｅｓ ｔｏ ｂｅ ｐａｔｉｅｎｔ ｗｉｔｈ\nｔｈｅ ｍｉｓｔａｋｅｓ ｏｆ ｏｔｈｅｒｓ.' a small flat square\nof wood (about the size of a cracker) carved\nwith the design of overlapping wings, and a\nvial of redstone dust mixed with salt.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Palm Frond Broom Head", "A well tied together bundle of palm fronds in\nthe shape of a broom head. Well suitable for\nuse either as a hand broom, to be put on the\nend of a stick, or for whatever 'broom\nrelated needs one might have.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:wheat", ""),
        StaticItem("Apocalypse", "A long, sharpened bone would appear to be in\nthe shape of a deformed longsword. The hilt\nis carved out of a jagged bone, engraved with\nmany undead symbols. The shaft consists of a\nrefined bone, most likely once being the leg\nof a large orc.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Capace.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Coin", "*Moderator Approved*\nWrynn approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Ironwood Pipe", "the pipe is seemingly grown from ironwood. It\nshines as if someone had just used the best\nmaterials to shine it and to a druid this\npipe feels alive, as if it was originally\nfrom an awoken staff and ingrained in the\nwood is Halfling's Grass, so even if you\nsmoked all of the grass it would still grow\nback over time, but this can be sped up using\ntheir druidic gifts, the one who obtains this\nmay never need another pipe ever again!\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Corvoo.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Roughspun Linen Cloth", "A rolled up square meter of roughspun linen,\nmade from dried flax. Though it may not feel\nespecially nice to the touch, it is a\nsurprisingly hardy cloth, that can take alot\nof strain.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("A Knight's Locket", "A necklace worthy of a knight. The chain of\nsuch felt thick and sturdy, made from a\nstrong material; perhaps ferrum. The trinket\nthat such a chain supported was circular in\nshape and, at a glance, seemed to be a basic\nsignet of the Palaiologos family. Upon a\nferrum circle the sigil was embeded, colored\nruby and aurum. However, upon closer\ninspection did the wearer find the trinket to\nbe a locket. A tiny, delicate clasp ensured\nthat the locket remained securely closed.\nShould the wearer open it, he would be\ngreeted by a tiny image which seemed to\ndepict Demetrios and Artemis Palaiologos. As\nthe locket was turned around, one would find\na single diamond seated dead center, the\nphrase \"My Light in the Dark\" circling around\nit.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Lirinya.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Truffle", "A single black truffle about the size of a\nchicken egg. Its lumpy surface emanating a\npungent and delectable odor. It would seem to\nhave been washed well enough, no visible dirt\nor grime can be seen uponthe truffle's skin.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:coal", ""),
        StaticItem("Magical Gift", "Upon opening the elaborate lid you discover a\ndelightful item inside! [Pm MisterPapiOfLOTC\nto redeem]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Scimitar", "The writing \"Hisuan\" is engraved onto the\nblade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by J5_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("A Large Severed Gorilla Hand", "The might fist of an epic beast! This rough\nhand must have belonged to an ancient\ncreature to reach this size! It could\nprobably do some damage if you swung it\naround! Here, let me give you a hand!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:stone_axe", ""),
        StaticItem("Crab Ovaries", "The ovaries of a giant crab, harvested on the\n14th of Sun's Smile, 1627\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Stazsak blade", "The blade is decorated from tip to pommel\nwith decorative gemstones and gold. Emeralds\nadorn each face of the blade, three\ndescending from the tip to the golden\ncrossguard. The grip itself is lined with\ngold and a diamond rests in a golden socket\nat it's base. Conquered from Romanos\nPalaiologos by Lord Nicolas Rubens.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Chaw.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Austere Whetstone", "A simple, blocky whetstone of basic quality,\nused for sharpening various blades and\nknives. An intrinsic item, useful for any\nwhose profession revolves around a blade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:brick", ""),
        StaticItem("White Truffle", "A single white truffle a bit smaller than a\nchicken egg, its lumpy surface emanating a\ngentle, pungent odor. It seems to've been\nwashed very well, bearing no distinguishable\nblemishes or spots.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Auric_Saint.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Dwarven Pocket Watch", "The small pocket watch is an intricate golden\npiece made by the most skilled of dwarven\nhands. The time is accurate to the second\nwithout need of winding or tuning.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:clock", ""),
        StaticItem("A Loving Union", "A finely carved wood statue, not much bigger\nthan a drinking goblet. The wood would be\ncarefully carved in the shape of two animals.\nA horse and a twin headed eagle, which were\nholding their heads against eachother in a\nloving gesture. The bending of their necks to\neachother and the two animals splitting from\neachother at the base gave the entire thing a\nheart-like shape.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:planks", ""),
        StaticItem("The Blade of the Twin Headed Eagle", "A large war sword, the heirloom of House\nPalaiologos. The pommel is shaped like a twin\nheaded eagle, covered in gold. The grip is\ncovered in redish gold wise. The crossguard\nappears to be shaped like eagle's wings\ntowards the end, with the name of House\ncarved in the middle. Carved on the blade are\nwords in a foreign dialect.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by RammerJammer73.", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("The Knight's Locket", "A necklace worthy of a knight. The chain felt\nthick and sturdy, made from strong iron. The\ntrinket hanging from the chain was circular\nin shape, and at first glance, a basic signet\nof the Palaiologos family. Upon the ferrum\ncircle, was the sigil embedded. colored by\nruby and aurum. However, upon closer\ninspection, it would turn out to be a locket.\nIf opened, one saw a picture of Demetrios and\nArtemis. Upon the back, one would find a\nsingle diamond encircled with \"My light in\nthe dark.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by cyber_king3.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Palaiologosian Eagle", "An awe-inspiring two-headed eagle cast in\nsolid, unscathed gold and mounted on a dark\nwood plinth. Ths eagle, with its twin\nheadssnaking about one another, boasts\nstunning craftsmanship, from the gold spines\nof its feathers, to the talons digging into\nthe plinth. When held up to firelight, the\nflames dance against its gleaming surface,\nlending it an incandescant glow.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:brewing_stand", ""),
        StaticItem("Sangkruv", "A longsword of beautiful craftsmanship,\nholding a broad, yet two-edged blade of\nrefined black ferrum. The hilt itself is made\nfrom a wyvern's bone adorned in aurum, shaven\ndown to have the red velvet grip wrap tightly\naround it. Placed firmly on the end of the\nhilt would be a globed pommel, fitting a\nglistening emerald of estranged sorts. It\nbares a lenticular crossguard of gilded black\nferrum, weighing the sword some fair balance\nto the one gripping it. With a powerful blow,\nand a bliss to the common man's eye, this\nsword is definitely one to live through\ntales.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by chihiros.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Lamb", "A pretty, lambshaped stuffed toy. It'd be\nmade mostly of wool, being extremely soft to\nthe touch, and nicely stuffed, to give it\nthat soft, comforting feel. The head had eye\npaterns sewn into for eyes, aswell as a\nsmile. Overal, a pretty toy for a young\nchild.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ioannis.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Buckfast Tonic Wine", "A dark red wine that has been mixed with\nvarious spices to create a hearty drink.\nCan be served hot or cold.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Cacâvûuk", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Westerlands Military Coin", "A solid iron pin depicting crossed daggers.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by RancidHound.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Snake Scale", "A glimmering scale which once belonged to a\ngiant creature, defeated by a heroic group of\nmen!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MisterPapiOfLOTC.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
        StaticItem("Vouruhks - Playing Card", "A large, ferocious bird that soars in the\nclouds and kills its prey in seconds. Often\nused by the Orcs as carrier ‘pidgeons'.\nStats: Health Points: 6 Stamina: 3/5 Damage:", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Coin of Edel", "A lapis coin from the nonexistent City of\nEdelburg.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Bokolo Feather", "An orange feather fallen from a bokolo's\nplumage\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Kukiii.", "minecraft:feather", ""),
        StaticItem("Gold Token", "A coin redeemable for 20 Minas", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Broomstick", "A fine broomstick made for cleaning a house\nfrom dust", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Stuffed Potato", "Potatos with cheese and gravy fillings.\nFood: 7\nSaturation: 12.0\nThe rotten food reeks of fungi.", "minecraft:baked_potato", ""),
