        StaticItem("Frosty Super Cheddar", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Roll of Bandages", "", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Magnolia Flower", "A medium sized flower. It still smelt sweet,\nand had been recently picked.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Anne's Engagement Ring", "The silver ring would be laced with an\nintertwining gold design in a stunning flower\npattern that would go all around the ring.\nSmall sapphire gems would rest on the bottom\nand flank the sides, themselves flanked by\nclear crystals. A dark blue gem would rest on\nthe top, surrounded by four smaller, sparking\ndiamonds, as the metal around the gems would\nshape into a flower. On the inside, the\nphrase 'Tobias + Anne' is masterfully\nengraved.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
