        StaticItem("Boomsteel Handbomb", "A small cylinder of stable boomsteel alloy\nfilled with thanium. When the boomsteel is\nlit, it will take a few seconds before the\nheat from the flaming metal outside overloads\nthe thanium within. The thanium will explode\nsending hot shrapnel in a few meters radius.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by LadyRebecca.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Corgie Plushie Toy", "A plushie representation of a dog breed that\nprobably doesn't exist, but it's sho coote.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Caerme'onn's Repose", "A refreshing brew, dark green in color and\nflecked with particles of brown, due to the\nuse of certain herbs when making this drink.\nIt provides a sense of calmness and would\nleave the drinker feeling sluggish at first\nbut well rested after the effects have worn.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Draoichota's Coin", "This coin would be some sort of magical gold.\nOne side having the face of a merry gnome,\nthe other a crude rainbow. It would seem to\nalways flip gnome side up, apart from\nspecific occasions [Contact BedsareBurning to\nInteract]\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Corrupted Coin", "A gold coin with the face of Grimdugan on one\nface, the other side being blacked out.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Skeletal Sword", "A regular longsword! But wait...! Across the\nmetal of the hilt you would find what looked\nlike carvings of bones. The metal sphere at\nthe bottom of the hilt would have been\nfashioned into a skull by an expert smith!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by TheMoonMonk.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Feona'Lak Action Figurine", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Begotten.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Shards of Dark Armour", "You hold in your hand shards of the Ethereal\nBeings armour, it pulsates with a distinct\npower. It appears useless, perhaps it will\nhave some use in the future?", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Dwarven Diamond", "★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:diamond", ""),
        StaticItem("Ancient Warhammer", "A formidable long-handled warhammer. The\nexuberant gold that once shined bright on the\nwarhammer has clearly withered away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:golden_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Dungrimm's Papyrus", "A long scroll containing extremely faded\nDwarven writing. It appears to contain a very\nlong and detailed list of some sort. Most\nitems on the list are crossed off.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Veil", "A type of ancient currency.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Ancient Axios Dwarves.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("A Note", "Γι 'αυτό και πήγε στο κατάστημα και αγόρασε\nμερικά αυγά αλλά και μερικοί άλλοι με\nαγνόησαν.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by arockstar28.", "minecraft:paper", ""),
        StaticItem("Spoiling Bloodseed", "This is bloodseed, derived from an elder\ntree. It requires watering with genus, in the\nform of fresh blood, to grow -- furthermore,\nit requires tending to by druids, or it will\nperish. Those attuned sense hurt coming from\nthe tree, which can be soothed by kindness.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Aesopian.", "minecraft:wheat_seeds", ""),
        StaticItem("Moon-Kissed Candle", "A pale wax candle that burned endlessly atop\na small golden candle plate. The flickering\nflame was a soft blue color though didn't\nseem to offer any warmth or heat. It didn't\nburn others and only itself for eternity. If\nyou put your ear to it, whispers would seduce\nyou into mindlessness until you pried\nyourself away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:redstone_torch", ""),
        StaticItem("Black Rose", "A small black rose that never wilted or\nsuccumbed to disease naturally. The rare\nplant was blessed by the forests. Small wisps\nof pale green mist jumping between each petal\nand leaf.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Hallow's Eve Pumpkin", "A sinister grin was etched across its\nterrifying features, with eyeless sockets\nthat burned into the center of your soul. The\npumpkin never succumbed to rot or disease.\nThough as it was held, you could sometimes\nsee piercing red eyes staring at you out of\nthe corner of your eye.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Hallow's Eve.", "minecraft:pumpkin", ""),
        StaticItem("Miniature Druidnuke", "What appears to be a few small bush seeds,\nnormal in appearance. To an attuned druid,\nthey radiate more natural energy than one\nwould expect. In reality, they are various\nungrown shrub seeds, and when thrown down,\nwill immediately /burst/ into a full grown\nbush, of medium bush size.", "minecraft:tallgrass", ""),
        StaticItem("Green Mint", "", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("-=Thunderkrug=-", "A minty tasting powder that is very cold\nand chilling to the touch. Just the auroma\nprovides the holder with a chilling sensation\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Dtrik.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Krugium", "This drug could be called opium if it was as\nweak as one. A red powder, tinted by unknown\nmeans, maybe even nature. The difference from\nthe krugium and the opium is that the krugium\nhas its plant derived from the jungle. It\nappears to be mixtured with a very tiny\nammount of night sap. In a matter of one or\ntwo minutes, the user will feel relaxed,\nsleepy, happy and numb all across the body,\nbut with a more pleasant feeling, forcing him\nto sleep after the use. Addicts a person\neasily.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Sandk1ng.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Ruhn oz Varekan", "The metal sphere is rather cool to the touch\nbut warms upon activation. The curving shapes\nof the runes across the surface light up at\nthe touch of the user and emit a bring\nwhite-blue light from across the entire\nsurface of the sphere. As it is with all\nrunes, the runes would cease to work without\na timely renewal and would stop working all\ntogether after several uses.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Perplexed_Aris.", "minecraft:glowstone", ""),
        StaticItem("Lareh", "A large warhammer fitted with a hammer head\nand a warspike on the other side, made of\nCarbarum. The shaft would be made of\nIronwood, reinforced with iron near the head\nand varnished to a smooth finish with the\nhandle area’s bound in a dark red leather.\nThe butt would be fitted with a spike pommel.", "minecraft:iron_pickaxe", ""),
        StaticItem("Never-ending flask [Wine]", "A seemingly empty flask, but when you take a\nsip, wine comes out of it. It appears it\ndoesn’t have an end, where does it come from?\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by TauFirewarrior.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Cold One", "An mug of light ale overflowing with the\nfroth.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Tavern_Roleplay.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
        StaticItem("Snake Skin", "The shedded skin of a black snake.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by oncenoeda.", "minecraft:carpet", ""),
        StaticItem("Tooth of a Giant Squid", "Large and menacing, this sharpened denture is\nquite dangerous. It would make quite a fine\ntrophy, but perhaps a creative craftsmen\ncould find a use for it.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SquirtGun.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Feta", "A claymore that seems rather out of place\nwith it’s massive Carbarum blade with a twin\nfuller to take some of the weight off. It\nwould glisten in the light from the odd\nmetal/gem mixture. The hilt would be wrapped\nin a white leather, leading down to the\npommel which takes on the shape of a roaring\nlion, made from the same material as the\nblade.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Boar Tusk", "You hold in your hand a long curved Boar\nTusk! It is clearly quite sharp and comes to\na menacing point at the end.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by White_Wolf.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Draconic Staff", "A staff forged of a white draconic bone, a\nlittle over one meter in length. The top of\nit was carved into a dragon's skull, teeth\nwrapped around a large and round ruby gem.\nThose that knew how this staff functioned\nwould be capable of causing bursts of fire to\nexude off the end of it. ((Three charges\nbefore refueling, and 3 emote buildup per\nuse. PM Fury_Fire))", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Aurum Lance", "A lance designed to dismount\nother horse riders while on horseback.", "minecraft:golden_shovel", ""),
        StaticItem("Naval Blade", "A shortsword of a long forgotten\npirateer, rope knotted around its handle\nbeautifully,a copper charm of an anchor\nbeing strung to it carefully. The scent\nof sea salt would cling to the blade, and\nto anyone whom the sea is important to,\nit would bring memories rushing back to\nthem.\n★Moderator Approved★\nSigned by iLovePumpkins.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Amulet of the Four", "The amulet depicts six hooded figures, one at\neach corner of the smooth metal. It glows a\nsoft blue hue, and from time to time seems to\nvibrate in the holder's grasp.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by SpiffyTaylor.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Armor-piercing Arrowhead", "", "minecraft:flint", ""),
