        StaticItem("Pink shield", "Craft together with a banner\nin your 2x2 matrix to\nadd patterns.", "minecraft:shield", ""),
        StaticItem("Infernal Rod", "A sturdy, 1'6 wand like object carved from\nwhat appears to be draconic bone A large\nfiery hued topaz would rest at one in within\na carved dragon's maw - Two smaller rubies\nresting in either eye socket which would take\non a fiery tint upon activation. The objects\nlength would be carved with a scale like\npattern, and its grip crafted from tough\nWyvern hide. Should one utter a certain\ncommand the rod would let loose a great fiery\ntorrent from the topaz at its end within a\nthree meter range!\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Fitermon.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Twin Staff", "One of two twin staves, with two sharp\nlooking diamond gems upon each end. Along it\nwould be a great many smaller gems, each\ngiving an occasional shimmer of energy. It's\nclearly magical.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Fury_Fire.", "minecraft:stick", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Shortsword", "The steel of the shortsword is trimmed in\ndark red runes. They glow softly at the touch\nof the warrior who wields it. Masterfully\netched by the Arcadian Runesmiths, the sword\nitself is a powerful weapon. With each\nstrike, the runes flare and the blade is\nengulfed in a flash of fire. It seems to\nprotect the wielder from any backlash beyond\nthe pommel.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Bjørn Klö", "An old northern style broad sword, an ornate\nthree lobed pommel would crown the base. Old\nrunes are carved into the tang, just below\nthe plain iron guard. A newer lorraine cross\nwould be etched on the hilt. ‡\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by RealMinea.\nWhen in main hand:\n-2.4 Attack Speed\n+7 Attack Damage\n+29% Attack Damage", "minecraft:diamond_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Aeriels Protection", "This Golden chestplate would emit a faint\nglow, there would be a rune of Aeriel, which\nwould bring great harm if an undead comes in\ncontact with the chestplate, the rune would\nsoon ware off but would need to be recharged,\nthere would be a sigil Mariane'a Abernathy\nunder the chestplate as the forger of this\ngrand piece\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Xarkly.", "minecraft:golden_chestplate", ""),
        StaticItem("Claw of the Watcher", "A large, three taloned claw made of ivory.\nBlack streaks would be seen across the\ndraconic statuette. Strange symbols would be\ncarved in the palm area of the claw, with\nthree pictures of stone, fire and death. It\ncould be investigated or researched if enough\ntime was put into its observation. [PM\nBedsAreBurning to Interact]\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by BedsAreBurning.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Troll's Head", "★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Hoster102.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("TAX WARNING", "", "minecraft:snow", ""),
        StaticItem("Salted Food Box", "A salted box for food containment.\nClick on this item with uncooked food in your cursor to store.\nContains:\n0.37x Apple\nTo open, right click with the box in main hand.", "minecraft:piston", ""),
        StaticItem("A Pink Hairbrush", "A powder-pink hairbrush made from the rigid\nhairs of a wild horse rimmed with gold. On\nthe bottom is a golden tassel, and even the\ngentlest tug would release a double cartridge\nof lip rouge, one containing a soft, dainty\nblush hue, and the other a scarlet red.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Re-leaf", "A powerful, highly addictive drug that causes\nthe user to be much more aware in their\nsurroundings, increasing in activity,\ntalkativeness, wakefulness and decrease in\nfatigue. Despite all this, the user would\nalways feel relaxed but also experience a\nrush and decrease in appetite.", "minecraft:prismarine_shard", ""),
