        StaticItem("Piece of Undru's Robe", "It appears to look like some sort of flesh, together with\nred runes all over it. The runes seem to be from unknown\norigin and a strange whisper can always be heard\ncoming from this piece. Those that dare to hold it at their\nhome, will encounter nightmares while they are asleep.", "minecraft:fermented_spider_eye", ""),
        StaticItem("[H] Golden Skull", "God knows why someone\nwould cast a golden skull, but hey!\nIt's worth a pretty penny. [DO NOT PLACE DOWN]\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Mr. Mittens", "Here before you lies Mr. Mittens.\nAn innocent tabby with a very puffy tail.\nThe cat’s warm touch would comfort\neven the most stressed of souls.\n*Moderator Approved*\nfreema5 approved this item.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("GM Rompers", "What fine boots for swinging your ban hammer\ninto people's faces! Or perhaps you could\neven use them to tread over the ban appeals\nyou've just denied! Whatever the case, have\nsome fun in these dashing pair of GM boots.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Wrynn.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("★ Classic Suspicious Egg ★", "An egg that comes from questionable sources\nsince not everything can paint green colours\nor is naturally green. Maybe it even came\nfrom a bunny that ate a sunflower, but it\ndoesn't matters much since its lemon taste\nblends in perfectly with the chocolate. Happy\neaster!\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by SexeHexe.", "minecraft:skull", ""),
        StaticItem("Bundle of Overprotection", "A bundle of enhanced spider silk, capable of\nwarding off blows from arrows and sword\nstrikes. It will only wrap around infants\nhowever, seemingly turning into an ordinary\ncloth when utilized by adults. When bundled\naround an infant and held by someone, they\nwill occasionally see horrific images\nrevolving around the child for a split second\nbefore it fades back to normal. The adult\nwill also feel that it is necessary for the\nchild to have the cloth, as if it'll keep the\nchild extra-safe.\n★Lore Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantNoodle.", "minecraft:wool", ""),
        StaticItem("Ring of Roots", "A ring that would seem to be made of\nroots, grasping around one another. A\nsmall aquamarine sitting in the centre.\n*Moderator Approved*\niMattyz approved this item.", "minecraft:emerald", ""),
        StaticItem("Glorious Aengul Eye Necklace", "", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
        StaticItem("Frozen Heart", "A small black gem that is cold to the touch.", "minecraft:ghast_tear", ""),
        StaticItem("Ten Thorns", "A rather ornate shortsword with cuboid engravings along\nthe blade. The edges of the blade seem to flare out\nwith thorny edges that make the blade look as if\nit were trying to keep something away.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by _Leric_.", "minecraft:iron_sword", ""),
        StaticItem("Sturdy Iron Ring", "A noble ring rimed for only the sturdiest,\nstoutest workers. Its shine is everlasting,\npolish seeming almost holy. It serves as a\nreminder of the obligation and ethics of the\nhard-working working class.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Nani Kaphiri.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
