        StaticItem("Chirrs Collar", "", "minecraft:name_tag", ""),
        StaticItem("Banner of the Abyss", "A banner made of terrible quality cloth, bits\nof flayed skin woven into the pattern where\nholes seemed to once be. The crown of Ghamul\nis shown, atop a sprawling legion of undead,\nharkening back to the days of the Westerlands\ncrusade.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:banner", ""),
        StaticItem("Grobsnopper", "A reddish-orange plant with small pot sitting\nin the middle of its petals, this plant is\nknown by apothecaries as a strong\ndisinfectant on wounds. It is usually hanged\nabove a bed post to ward off disease.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
