        StaticItem("Cheza's Engagement Ring", "An elegant gold ring, encrusted with two\nsmall diamonds with a heart-shaped ruby\nin between them. Engraved on one side of the\nring are the words: \"My heart and soul to you\nfor ever and ever.\" On the other side is:\nCheza and Katari\".\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:gold_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Mosaic Sky", "A potent, mood-changing drug in the form of\ngelatin squares. Best taken in a comfortable\nenvironment as to not have a 'bad trip'.\nFeelings going into the experience are\nenhanced greatly.", "minecraft:stained_glass_pane", ""),
        StaticItem("Iron Pendant Necklace", "The one wearing this beautiful necklace is\nunable to stop themselves from falling\nin-love with the one who gave them it as a\ngift, as such they find it near impossible to\ngive it away.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Lord Knox.", "minecraft:iron_nugget", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Happiness", "Arcane I\nA pale dandelion that when held will grant\nthe person the sense of happiness and joy.\nTheir weights are lifted, and their spirits\nare high. Even after the flower is withdrawn\nfrom the person, the sense will linger at a\nmuch less potent rate.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:yellow_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Tranquility", "Arcane I\nA sea-blue sweet pea that when held will\ngrant the person a sense of serenity and\nstillness in any chaos from their life. This\nmystical flower is said to be used by even\nthe most eldest of druids in their direst\ntimes. The feelings will linger for some time\neven after the flower is gone.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Essence Reaper", "An aurum sickle that seems to have been forged\nrecently, cursed with a twisted dark magic. The\nsickle causes the aura of any pierced by it to\ndarken for a prolonged period of time. It also makes\nthose pierced feel gloomy and depressed for the\ncoming days, only to recover as the wound heals.\nThe gypsies claim it was once wielded by a necromantic\nlord who shepherded the dead with an iron fist.\n*Moderator Approved*\nGigarun approved this item.", "minecraft:golden_hoe", ""),
        StaticItem("Fabulous Heater Shield of Bashingness", "A simple leather heater shield\npainted a garish pink with four\nlarge and intimidating ferrum spikes\nprotruding from the center. Seems to\nbe very functional yet not functional\nat the same time. A mish-mash of\nodd traits for a shield...", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("A Shimmering Crystal", "The small crystal's surface\npulses with glowing blue veins,\nmuch like that of its twin.", "minecraft:nether_star", ""),
