        StaticItem("Black Squeaky Boots", "These black walking boots squeak. They squeak\nwith every footstep that the wearer makes!\nThe insides of the boot is lined with a soft\nwool-like material to provide extra comfort\nto each wearer's step as they squeak.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by August.", "minecraft:leather_boots", ""),
        StaticItem("Wyvern Bones", "The bones are very sturdy, and can be used to\nmake efficient weapons!\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Wyvern.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Runic Tankard", "The sides of the mug are ornately decorated\nwith etchings of glorious battles and vibrant\nfeasts. What draws your eye is the thin ring\nof runic symbols that ring the edge of the\nmug itself. Try as you might, you cannot seem\nto spill the contents but you have no problem\ndrinking. The piece is truly of Arcadian\nmake.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Josh3738.", "minecraft:flower_pot", ""),
        StaticItem("Wristlet of Soul Retention", "Within your hand rests a bracelet of\nexceptionally foreign craft, made entirely of\npure quartz crystal and nearly translucent.\nOccasionally, when in complete darkness,\nfaint flickers of ethereal white light can be\nseen dancing within the crystalline\nstructure. Upon each quartz bead is an image\nof a progressing story. A lady in billowing\nwhite robes stands defiant of a man in black\nwielding a scythe. He attempts to steal her\nsoul with the wicked weapon, but fails.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Enrohk.", "minecraft:quartz", ""),
        StaticItem("Leather Wine Bladder", "A jiggly leather sac with\nan uncorked opening made for\nholding water or wine. It\nseems like an effective means\nfor carrying liquids to and fro\nplaces.\n*Moderator Approved*\nVanir_ approved this item.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
        StaticItem("Flower of Affection", "Arcane I\nA crimson rose that when held will grant the\nperson a longing warmth within their heart,\nor simply strengthen the bonds they already\nshare. A truly romantic gift, or even\nsomething to give a family member. The\nfeelings, while lessened, will stay even\nafter the flower is no longer there.\n★Game Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Tahmas.", "minecraft:red_flower", ""),
        StaticItem("Jade Pendant", "A golden-chained pendant lays before you,\nnothing particularly standing out about the\npiece of jewelry aside from the hunk of jade\nat the center of it. Should someone wear\nthis, they will find their emotions somewhat\nlessened, making it much harder for them to\nbecome emotional over a matter. This effect\nwill cease should this be worn for 3 IRL\ndays. ((PM FlamboyantRage for more details.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Parkins.", "minecraft:gold_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("A Toy Dwedish Soldier", "A wooden soldier with articulated joints, the\nwork of a famed company of Dwarven toymakers.\nHis stern emerald eyes gaze out above a\npainted auburn beard, armour carved to\nresemble that of a Grand Legionnaire. The\nbottoms of his his sturdily-booted feet are\ncarved with inert Dwarven runes, set in a\nsemicircle about the heel. \"Narvak Urguan,\nthey read, \"Narvak Tumunzahar.\" Below these\nphrases, a maker's mark of the Emberhorn Clan\nis evinced.\n★Player Approved★\nSigned by _Fid_.", "minecraft:spruce_fence", ""),
        StaticItem("A Truly Despicable Act of Dark Magic", "A Vexgeist inhabits this plain iron ring,\nmistakenly called to it by a mystic. If worn\nfor prolonged periods of time by a mortal\nentity, they would find themself becoming\ndissatisfied with their current gender.\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by Toodles.", "minecraft:iron_ingot", ""),
        StaticItem("Endless Feast", "A rather festive box of goodies. It never\nseems to run out of delicious Krugmas food,\nwhich magically reappears each time it is\nopened. From ham to candied yams and grilled\ncactus, the spirit of Krugmas lives on\nforever in this mysterious, decorative box.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by MorriSaye.", "minecraft:chest", ""),
        StaticItem("Skywhale Droppings", "Large droppings produced by frightened\nskywhales.\n★Event Actor Approved★\nSigned by Bokermon.", "minecraft:dye", ""),
