        StaticItem("Arcane Umbrella", "A thin handle carved from stone with a\ndiamond placed in the bottom. Upon being\nactivated, arcane energy will spew from the\ntop and begin to solidify into a pink\nenergy'd dome, forming a makeshift umbrella.\nThis would shatter after a singular blow from\na weapon, making the tool not great for\ncombat. Will need recharging after extended\nuse. ((To clarify, this is an enchantment of\nan Arcane Tool from Arcanism.))\n★Magic Moderator Approved★\nSigned by FlamboyantPizza.", "minecraft:bone", ""),
        StaticItem("Potion of Dwarf's Pumpkin", "The results of brewing an\nherb in a base. Further\nbrewing may be required\nto complete the potion and\nenhance its attributes.\nA smelly, bitter bew.\nCan be drank, causing an effect similiar to alcohol.", "minecraft:potion", ""),
